									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Chomp Garden is a puzzle game about guiding plants with light.</strong></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >To catch up with your pup, you enter a garden full of strange plants.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Chomp Plants grow toward the light, Thief Plants move away from it, and Hidey Bushes can hide your light.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >You are a tiny lamp. Use your light to shape plants, solve puzzles, open the way forward, explore the garden, and find your pup.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Features</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Thoughtfully crafted puzzles</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Fun and surprising plant behaviors</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Little secrets hidden throughout the garden</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >A compact 1–2 hour puzzle experience</p></li></ul>						</div>
					</div>
